== OEBPS/text/0002.xhtml
<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!DOCTYPE html PUBLIC "-//W3C//DTD XHTML 1.1//EN" "http://www.w3.org/TR/xhtml11/DTD/xhtml11.dtd">
<html xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" xml:lang="ja">
<head>
<title>深い入れ子の節</title>
<link rel="stylesheet" type="text/css" href="../assets/%E7%94%BB%E5%83%8F%E9%9B%86/%E8%A3%85%E9%A3%BE.css"/>
</head>
<body>
<h1>深い入れ子の節</h1>
<ul>
<li>箇条書きの中の<span class="ruby"><span class="rb">漢字</span><span class="rp">（</span><span class="rt">かんじ</span><span class="rp">）</span></span><sup><a class="noteref" id="fnref-1" href="#fn-1">1</a></sup>
<ol>
<li>番号付き</li>
<li>二つ目</li>
</ol>
</li>
</ul>
<blockquote>
<p>引用の中の<span class="ruby"><span class="rb">ルビ</span><span class="rp">（</span><span class="rt">るび</span><span class="rp">）</span></span>と<sup><a class="noteref" id="fnref-2" href="#fn-2">2</a></sup>脚注。</p>
</blockquote>
<div class="footnotes"><div class="footnote" id="fn-1"><p><a href="#fnref-1">1</a> リストの注。</p></div><div class="footnote" id="fn-2"><p><a href="#fnref-2">2</a> 引用の注。</p><pre><code>注の中のコード《こーど》
</code></pre></div></div>
</body>
</html>

