== OEBPS/text/0007.xhtml
<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" xmlns:epub="http://www.idpf.org/2007/ops" xml:lang="en" lang="en">
<head>
<title>Footnotes in English</title>
<link rel="stylesheet" type="text/css" href="../assets/css/base.css"/>
<link rel="stylesheet" type="text/css" href="../assets/css/code.css"/>
</head>
<body>
<h1>Footnotes in English</h1>
<p>A claim<sup><a class="noteref" id="fnref-1" href="#fn-1" epub:type="noteref">1</a></sup> and another<sup><a class="noteref" id="fnref-2" href="#fn-2" epub:type="noteref">2</a></sup>, then the first again<sup><a class="noteref" id="fnref-1-2" href="#fn-1" epub:type="noteref">1</a></sup>.</p>
<div class="footnotes"><aside class="footnote" id="fn-1" epub:type="footnote"><p><a href="#fnref-1">1</a> A footnote with <code>code</code> and a <a href="https://example.com/">link</a>.</p></aside><aside class="footnote" id="fn-2" epub:type="footnote"><p><a href="#fnref-2">2</a> A footnote with two paragraphs.</p><p>The second paragraph.</p></aside></div>
</body>
</html>

